{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BazeJkvYT31793607785.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市在11月首個交易日普遍下跌。</p><p></p><p>日本股市連跌第二個交易日，險守63,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市三連跌，失守45,000點關口，澳洲股市回軟，終止過去兩日升勢。 </p><p></p><p>韓國股市則扭轉兩連跌，曾經反彈百分之3，收市升幅略為收窄至約百分之2。兩大權重股三星電子和SK海力士，升約百分之2至4。韓國政府承諾積極發展AI，並投資相關重點項目。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.703719+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.141287+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:51.612009+00:00","content_hash":"f9bcba037a83ac8bb057a7d4f1d12111df97b0286e7290792f0ea8c99624e656","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T09:23:42.703719+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}